  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/219/afbeelding_2024-04-20_033343232.png\" alt=\"Create: Deepfried 标题\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>由Create: Bitterballen开发团队制作的扩展模组</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/212/pastry_shop.png\" alt=\"模组中的糕点店场景\" width=\"500\" height=\"265\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>内容物：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span>柏林果酱包（多种馅料）</span></li>\n<li><span>德式苹果煎饼</span></li>\n<li><span>玉米热狗</span></li>\n<li><span>鸡块</span></li>\n<li><span>春卷</span></li>\n<li><span>天妇罗</span></li>\n<li><span>炸鱿鱼圈</span></li>\n<li><span>炸鱼薯条</span></li>\n<li><span>炸鸡</span></li>\n<li><span>木薯薯条</span></li>\n</ul><p><span><strong>安装农夫乐事模组可获得更多内容！</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span>洋葱圈</span></li>\n<li><span>开花洋葱</span></li>\n<li><span>意式炸饺</span></li>\n<li><span>未来将持续更新更多内容 :D</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/850/224/310/172/springrolls_fryer.png\" alt=\"油炸中的生春卷\" width=\"400\" height=\"246\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>开发计划：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span>非洲风味小吃</span></li>\n<li><span>大洋洲风味小吃</span></li>\n</ul><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><strong>常见问题：</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>会加入XX功能吗？</strong></span></p><p><span>如果是技术性功能可能会由C:Bitterballen主模组实现。如果是油炸类小吃，则属于本模组范畴。</span></p><p><span><strong>何时更新1.xx版本？</strong></span></p><p><span>本模组版本始终与C:Bitterballen同步，当前仅支持1.20.1和1.19.2版本。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><strong>必要前置：</strong></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力(Create)</a> - 提供动能系统</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-bitterballen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Bitterballen</a> - 提供机械油炸机</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><strong>推荐搭配：</strong></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a> - 解锁额外小吃</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><strong><span>功能辅助：</span><br></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a> -</strong>显示方块信息</span></p><p><span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> -</strong>查看合成配方</span></p><p><span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a> -</strong>显示食物属性</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>本模组使用<a href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力模组</a>修改素材制作，遵循MIT许可协议。</em></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSieyva\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f145a138-ea20-40c4-8c87-33fe627bd905.webp\" alt=\"使用优惠码Sieyva可享Bisect Hosting七五折\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
